# Allowlist, not a blocklist. This repo is PUBLIC and most files here carry
# course data that is deliberately not published — the full dashboard, the
# tracker, the to-dos, the CPEN 221 course notes, and the Canvas feed URL,
# which is a bearer secret. Ignore everything, then name what is safe.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Code
!*.py
!*.sh
!dashboard.template.html
!courses.example.json

# The redacted page GitHub Pages serves. docs/index.html is generated by
# `build_dashboard.py --public` and gated by check_public.py.
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/index.html
